@bank all
// The ending (E-1, EN2 for lead 39; plans/ending-spec.html, "The week"): the crossing back's own words in the events
// base's keys (as content/banks/event-crossingLine.lines). Mail is "Subject | body", unsigned. Stand-ins for SW6
// (about 110 lines with the meetings). Never "permission" or "leave" about the reach: the Wren "crosses back over the
// Line". Every Veyli is they/them. The Admiral is the Captain's fish.
== event.crossingBack.mail.warning
- Sunday we cross back over the Line | Sunday at 14:30 the Wren crosses back over the Line. The horn on every deck, then the oath in the bow lounge. You lead it this time: Basil is our only first-timer. The Line supper in the mess at 18:00.
== event.crossingBack.status.warning
- Sunday at 14:30: the Wren crosses back over the Line.
== event.crossingBack.status.onset
- Crossing back. The oath in the bow lounge: you lead it.
== event.crossingBack.status.resolution
- Crossed back over the Line. The Line supper's at 18:00.
== event.crossingBack.status.afterglow
- Back on our own side of the Line.
== event.crossingBack.notice.vanceComing
- Commander Vance is coming to find you.
== event.crossingBack.notice.vance
- Sunday at 14:30 the Wren crosses back over the Line. You lead the oath, in the bow lounge.
== event.crossingBack.notice.ship
- Taavek's ship is off the bow again. Look out of the bow glass.
== event.crossingBack.notice.morning
- Today at 14:30 the Wren crosses back over the Line. You lead the oath in the bow lounge.
== event.crossingBack.notice.horn
- The horn. The Wren is crossing back over the Line. To the bow lounge: you lead the oath.
== event.crossingBack.arrow.oath
- Lead the oath: the bow lounge, at the front
== event.crossingBack.arrow.ship
- Taavek's ship, off the bow: the bow lounge
== event.crossingBack.say.saruth
- Company, the other way.
// the ceremony's crowd (the gathering's tap lines, and asking you along 14:00-14:30)
== event.crossingBack.gather.ceremony.name
- Crossing back
== event.crossingBack.gather.ceremony.ask
- Crossing back at half two. You're leading the oath, I hear.
- Bow lounge at half two. Come on, you're the one reading.
== event.crossingBack.gather.ceremony.here
- Four weeks. Feels like a year and a day.   #warm
- Basil's face when the punch comes. Watch it.   #funny
== event.crossingBack.gather.ceremony.thanks
- You stand at the front of the bow lounge with the crowd behind you, and read the old oath for Basil. The Veyli ship's lights hang off the bow.   #warm
// the Line supper, again (the Sunday table re-dressed on Day 35)
== event.crossingBack.gather.lineSupper.name
- The Line supper
== event.crossingBack.gather.lineSupper.mail
- The Line supper | The Line supper again tonight at six, in the mess. Same rules as last time: proper food to take the taste away.
== event.crossingBack.gather.lineSupper.ask
- Line supper at six. Second one. Still no punch.   #funny
== event.crossingBack.gather.lineSupper.here
- To the Line. Both ways.   #warm
== event.crossingBack.gather.lineSupper.thanks
- The mess is full again, every bench taken, and someone has saved you a place.   #warm
// a toast at the supper, coloured by your answer (a bubble near you in the mess; 60 at most)
== event.crossingBack.toast.stay
- To {me}, who's staying! Somebody had to.   #warm
- To the one who said no to headquarters!   #funny
== event.crossingBack.toast.go
- To {me}. Headquarters doesn't know what's coming.   #warm
- To our Line-crosser, off to the Concord!
== event.crossingBack.toast.open
- To the Line. Both ways, and all of us.   #warm
// the Captain's address as the record (a Mail, or the banner if you weren't in the lounge)
== event.crossingBack.address.stay.1
- This is the Captain. We've crossed back over the Line.
== event.crossingBack.address.stay.2
- Some of you have heard: {me} stays with the Wren. We're keeping them.
== event.crossingBack.address.go.1
- This is the Captain. We've crossed back over the Line.
== event.crossingBack.address.go.2
- Monday {me} leaves us for Concord headquarters. The shuttle bay at ten.
== event.crossingBack.address.open.1
- This is the Captain. We've crossed back over the Line.
== event.crossingBack.address.open.2
- Well done, all of you. The Line supper's at six. Marrow out.
// your Line certificate's second date (the keepsake's tap text once you've crossed back), and the Record
== event.crossingBack.keepsake
- Your Line certificate, signed by the Captain twice: into the Veyli reach on Day 7, and back over the Line on Day 35.
== event.crossingBack.record
- Crossed back over the Line, Day 35. Led the oath.
